completed_at: "2026-10-27T07:14:15.000Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Hound no longer lints generated dist/ output; no other lint or gate changes
resolution: "Delivered by https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ado/pull/54 (merge 64aca03cb7c2, head 2230d99873f8)"
expected_result: Hound no longer lints generated dist/ output; no other lint or gate changes
actual_result: "Merged at 2026-10-27T07:14:15Z; no readable required checks, so every completed head check run had to succeed, be neutral or be skipped; successful checks: CodeQL, CodeRabbit, codeql, release gate (bun), release gate (npm), test (22), test (26)"
comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-27T01:14:59.337Z",codex-agent,"Plan: copy the documented pm-slack .hound.yml configuration, disabling only Hound JSHint. Preserve package lint and release gates. Verify the configuration fails when reverted, run both release gates with isolated Git identity and at most two CPUs, regenerate the changelog, and open an unmerged PR. Item remains open for orchestrator verification."
  "2026-10-27T01:15:24.686Z",codex-agent,"Configuration revert proof: the focused Node assertion passes with .hound.yml present, fails when the new file is removed, then passes after restoring its exact bytes. No source behavior or package gates change."
  "2026-10-27T01:15:39.652Z",codex-agent,"Configuration revert proof: the focused Node assertion passes with .hound.yml present, fails when the new file is removed, then passes after restoring its exact bytes. No source behavior or package gates change."
  "2026-10-27T01:15:59.694Z",codex-agent,"Configuration revert proof: the focused Node assertion passes with .hound.yml present, fails when the new file is removed, then passes after restoring its exact bytes. No source behavior or package gates change."
  "2026-10-27T01:47:01.302Z",codex-agent,"Validation: focused Hound assertion passed with a failing configuration revert proof. Full Bun release:check passed 252/252 tests in each coverage run, with unchanged 100% thresholds. The npm attempt stopped at 245/246 because the public registry timed out fetching the pinned CLI (ETIMEDOUT). The unchanged packed-install test subsequently passed 7/7 under Node 26 with .hound.yml removed, confirming the failure is independent of the config. Both full gate attempts used isolated Git identity and limited workers. CI will independently run both unchanged gates; no source or gate changes are warranted. Final changelog regeneration and check follow these tracker writes."
